    "detailed_description": "After waking up with no memory of who you are or where you are, you must investigate the apartment where you are currently situated for any potential clues that could provide insight into the situation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKetamine is a puzzle game with elements of horror, set in a building with three apartments, each with a puzzle piece that can reveal what your memory wants to hide. Why are you there? Where are the other residents? What happened in this mysterious place? And most importantly, how do you escape?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- First-person exploration with puzzles to solve and pieces to fit together.<br />\r\n- Atmosphere with horror elements.<br />\r\n- Designed to be a one-session experience lasting 30-60 minutes.",
